     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CarePlan example-careplan-multiple</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple\"> </a><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple-en-US\"> </a><p><b>status</b>: Active</p><p><b>intent</b>: Plan</p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Bundle-ex-diab-journey-1-transaction.html#urn-uuid-0fed5ebe-ca8f-4ad1-aba4-ddad45bd6cc8\">Susanne Testpatientin</a></p><p><b>addresses</b>: </p><ul><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/plan-gerds\">GERDS</a></li><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/plan-obesity\">Obesity</a></li><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/plan-psoriasis\">Psoriasis</a></li></ul><p><b>goal</b>: </p><ul><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-diet\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></li><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-symptoms-2\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></li><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></li><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-medication-4\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></li><li><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-light-treatment-5\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></li></ul><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve eats one meal a day with her parents ( @2012-09-10)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-diet\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>Not Started</td><td>false</td><td>2012-09-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will review photos of high and low density foods and share with her parents</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve will sleep in her bed more often than the couch ( @2012-09-10)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Kind</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td>CommunicationRequest</td><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-diet\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>Not Started</td><td>false</td><td>2012-09-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will ask her dad to asist her to put the head of her bed on blocks</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-symptoms-2\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-09-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will reduce her intake of coffee and chocolate</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve would like to try for 5 days a week. ( @2012-08-27), Eve is still walking the dogs. ( @2012-09-10)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-08-27 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will walk her friend's dog up and down a big hill 15-30 minutes 3 days a week</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve walked 4 times the last week. ( @2012-08-13), Eve did not walk to her parents the last week, but has plans to start again ( @2012-09-10)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will walk 3 blocks to her parents house twice a week</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-medication-4\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will use a calendar to check off after medications are taken</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: After restarting the vinegar soaks the psoriasis is improved and Eve plans to treat the remainder with light treatments.  She plans to start this week. ( @2012-08-13), Since her skin is improved Eve has not been using the light treatment as often, maybe once a week.  She would like to increase to 3 times a week again ( @2012-08-27)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-light-treatment-5\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will use her lights MWF after her shower for 3 minutes</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve created a chart as a reminer to take the medications that do not fit in her pill box ( @2012-07-23)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-medication-4\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will use a calendar of a chart to help her remember when to take her medications</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Will be able to esume exercise. ( @2012-07-30), Eve prefers to focus on walking at this time ( @2012-08-13)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>On Hold</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will start using stretch bands and one step 2 days a week Mon/Wed 6-7am and maybe Friday afternoon</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-medication-4\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>Completed</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will match a printed medication worksheet with the medication bottles at home</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve now has some of her medications set up in pill packs by her pharmacist ( @2012-07-16)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-medication-4\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>Completed</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will get a medication box to sort her pills.  She will have one for scheduled medications and one for as needed</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve will be able to resume exercise on 7/30/12 ( @2012-07-12), hold until &quot;less busy&quot; ( @2012-08-13)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td/><td><a href=\"#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3\">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>On Hold</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will open &quot;The Firm&quot; DVD workout package and listen to it</td></tr></table></blockquote><p><b>note</b>: Patient family is not ready to commit to goal setting at this time.  Goal setting will be addressed in the future</p><hr/><blockquote><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Condition #plan-gerds</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/plan-gerds\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple/plan-gerds\"> </a><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/plan-gerds-en-US\"> </a><p><b>clinicalStatus</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical active}\">Active</span></p><p><b>verificationStatus</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-ver-status confirmed}\">Confirmed</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">GERDS</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Bundle-ex-diab-journey-1-transaction.html#urn-uuid-0fed5ebe-ca8f-4ad1-aba4-ddad45bd6cc8\">Susanne Testpatientin</a></p></blockquote><hr/><blockquote><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Condition #plan-obesity</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/plan-obesity\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple/plan-obesity\"> </a><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/plan-obesity-en-US\"> </a><p><b>clinicalStatus</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical active}\">Active</span></p><p><b>verificationStatus</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-ver-status confirmed}\">Confirmed</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Obesity</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Bundle-ex-diab-journey-1-transaction.html#urn-uuid-0fed5ebe-ca8f-4ad1-aba4-ddad45bd6cc8\">Susanne Testpatientin</a></p></blockquote><hr/><blockquote><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Condition #plan-psoriasis</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/plan-psoriasis\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple/plan-psoriasis\"> </a><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/plan-psoriasis-en-US\"> </a><p><b>clinicalStatus</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical active}\">Active</span></p><p><b>verificationStatus</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-ver-status confirmed}\">Confirmed</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Psoriasis</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Bundle-ex-diab-journey-1-transaction.html#urn-uuid-0fed5ebe-ca8f-4ad1-aba4-ddad45bd6cc8\">Susanne Testpatientin</a></p></blockquote><hr/><blockquote><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Goal #goal-reduce-gerds-diet</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-diet\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-diet\"> </a><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-diet-en-US\"> </a><p><b>lifecycleStatus</b>: Active</p><p><b>description</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Eve will lose weight and reduce her GERDS symptoms by improving her diet</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Bundle-ex-diab-journey-1-transaction.html#urn-uuid-0fed5ebe-ca8f-4ad1-aba4-ddad45bd6cc8\">Susanne Testpatientin</a></p></blockquote><hr/><blockquote><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Goal #goal-reduce-gerds-symptoms-2</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-symptoms-2\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-symptoms-2\"> </a><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/goal-reduce-gerds-symptoms-2-en-US\"> </a><p><b>lifecycleStatus</b>: Active</p><p><b>description</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Eve will improve her GERDS symptoms</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Bundle-ex-diab-journey-1-transaction.html#urn-uuid-0fed5ebe-ca8f-4ad1-aba4-ddad45bd6cc8\">Susanne Testpatientin</a></p></blockquote><hr/><blockquote><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Goal #goal-increase-energy-3</b></p><a name=\"example-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-ener